<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- The ca7 reply brief's Word styles; fb render builds docx/reference.docx from pandoc's default reference with
     them (tools/fb/src/docxref.rs; were docx/build-reference.sh's). Times New Roman (typst/ca7-reply-brief.typ):
     12 pt body and 11 pt footnotes (Cir. R. 32(b)); exact 27.65 pt (553 twips, the typst body baseline pitch,
     double spacing per FRAP 32(a)(4)) with a 0.5 in first-line indent; single-spaced headings, footnotes, block
     quotations, cover, tables and certificates; headings keep with the next paragraph, widow control. Numbered
     headings: CAHeadL<level>S<step>, the label at <step> half-inches and the text hanging a half inch after it.
     Page setup and the footers are fb render's (rIdFtrNone, rIdFtrPage; docx/ca7-reply-brief.lua writes the
     sections and FORMBOOK_FINAL). -->
